            id: "invar",
            title: "Invar",
            icon: "arcforge:invar_ingot",
            description: [
                "Smelt Invar Dust (2 Iron Dust + 1 Nickel Dust) for Invar Ingots. Invar barely expands with heat, so its plates line the Hardened Thermodynamic Conduit and Heat Cell, the Haber Reactor and the Superheater; Invar Rods make the Sifter's second mesh.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:invar_ingot}, {item:arcforge:invar_plate}, {item:arcforge:invar_gear}, {item:arcforge:invar_rod}"
